  },
  {
    "sequence": 402,
    "start": 1247.32,
    "duration": 2,
    "text": "歐拉布拉歐拉布拉羅地區的"
  },
  {
    "sequence": 403,
    "start": 1249.32,
    "duration": 0.6000000000001364,
    "text": "路上有什麼樣的"
  },
  {
    "sequence": 404,
    "start": 1249.92,
    "duration": 1.3199999999999363,
    "text": "不過我告訴你是"
  },
  {
    "sequence": 405,
    "start": 1251.24,
    "duration": 2.5599999999999454,
    "text": "是因為你對於這件事我們是在一個"
